        "nobel_worthiness": "A decisive materials discovery with exceptional and enduring scientific and technological consequences for modern permanent-magnet applications.",
        "attribution": "Sagawa and Croat are the two credited experimental innovators; the compact attribution is a major strength.",
        "maturity": "The materials class has been extensively reproduced, understood, optimized and deployed over decades.",
        "uncertainties": [
